-- There is no regularity. At a neutral B, e and x, transport along ua e
-- stays stuck, so uaBeta does not hold by refl. (At closed values of Fin n
-- it holds: see uaBetaPlus3 in examples/glue.lang.)
def bad : (A : Type 0) -> (B : Type 0) -> (e : Equiv A B) -> (x : A) -> Path B (transport A B (ua A B e) x) (witness e x) :=
  fun (A : Type 0) => fun (B : Type 0) => fun (e : Equiv A B) => fun (x : A) => refl
